        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 ’Maanna theic bammei ta zianna gulou o,",
            "Paapc lev t’rou khou }?2 zianna zay pat ro;",
            "Bowmei ta zay thau o, ’khuaimei khang kap bo,",
            "Jisu gulou ngammei lam dinclou tio.",
            "",
            "’Maanna theic bammei ta zianlou, gulou o;",
            "Jisu zauzian thay e, gulou ngam e.",
            "",
            "2 Thouh sw mak bam sihni Kamei thu ’khwan bam,",
            "Lunghlaicna guangmei nunc ta laalou khang;",
            "Meic nunc khou lunghgutna ’zianna saalou o;",
            "Kaniw lwmlou ethei kuaklou puni.",
            "",
            "3 ’Thiammei }?2 meic nunc lung zynna bow bam the,",
            "Zauzian }?2 bakmei lung tiigay ngam e;",
            "Zianna kahi pwkhou, kadanlou pwkhou,",
            "’Suanmei, bowmei nunc thau dat ngam puni.",
            "",
            "4 ’Maanmei ta gulou o, mi hei nang thouc e,",
            "Poubauhmei }?2 pumtan tiilou puni;",
            "’Khaengvthayna zaylou tio, nrumpui chaeng khou;",
            "Guloumei pu theihmei chamv dinclou tio."
          ]
        }
